    The link opens the contract on a [blockchain explorer](https://docs.ton.org/llms/onboarding/explorers/content.md) showing transactions, messages and [account states](https://docs.ton.org/llms/foundations/status/content.md).

    Next, interact with the contract by sending messages and calling getter functions.
  </Step>
</Steps>

